## My thoughts on AI

I think AI can be a useful tool, especially when working on large projects. But it should support people, not replace them: humans should stay involved, make decisions, and do meaningful work — rather than quietly handing over all agency. AI is a powerful assistant, not the owner of the work, and the people behind the code should always get the credit and remain in control.

